{"server":"tw","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_05_beg","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_05","title":"通往舞會的邀請函","storyCode":"SS-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e1c5cb425747dfe3ec873c7d4028e5c025f59435227993364c6b96170a1c8504","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在睦的夢境中，保留著原本記憶的睦並沒有選擇離開夢境，而是決定在雷姆必拓當一個普通的小女孩。原本想要勸睦離開的祥子發現睦在這裡的生活比以往任何時候都還幸福，難以抉擇的她決定在睦表演時離席。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g10_dreamcastlestage"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g9_warmrabbitnest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥，來，喝下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喉嚨沒有那麼痛了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。這個給你，雷姆必拓到處都是沙塵，一定要拿好水袋和護目鏡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子接過睦遞來的物資，她的雙手緊緊地握著它們，鼓脹的水袋好像隨時都會被擠破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥，你有點奇怪，是不是不舒服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睦，你……還記得我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得我們經歷過的那些事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我全都記得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子感覺自己終於變得冷靜了一點，她開始環顧四周——\n方才她們順著狹長的礦道一直深入，最終來到了這裡。\n這裡陰暗潮濕，只有油燈和爐火提供著微弱的光亮。\n床與餐桌之間僅有一人寬的空隙，而從桌上水杯的數量來看，居住在這裡的絕對不只睦一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睦，你……已經在這裡生活多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一年，也許更久。在這裡需要考慮的事很簡單，時間的流逝也沒有那麼明顯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……你對時間沒有任何感覺，是因為你身處在夢裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睦，你為什麼會做這樣一個夢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夢……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睦，我有重要的事和你說。這裡不是現實，我們現在應該——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀——小睦，你怎麼現在就回來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個身影從身後跑了進來，直接將睦撲倒在柔軟的小床上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽、媽媽，身上有灰，先等一下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，都快一天沒見面了，讓我抱一下嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有、有人……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，小祥也在這裡啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好久沒來我們家了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"南小姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，怎麼這麼見外啦，叫“南”就好了啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我有時也會這麼叫媽媽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睦，你和南小姐的關係什麼時候變得這麼好了……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的關係一直都很好啊，畢竟是母女嘛~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小睦，今天的收穫怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（翻找口袋）今天天氣有點熱，買黃瓜汁的人比平常多一點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"睦小心翼翼地將手中的布袋打開，裡面是一些零星的硬幣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——小睦，你好棒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（翻翻口袋）喏，這是我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇……媽媽好厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，不知道為什麼，今天找我修補衣服的人特別多哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你爸爸今天也很努力哦，在工地裡忙了一整天。我送午餐給他的時候，看到他那副灰頭土臉的樣子實在不忍心，就特別允許他收工之後去喝一小杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他現在啊——應該已經一大瓶啤酒下肚了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛好今天小祥來了，機會難得，不如我們請大家一起來吃飯吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家能聚在一起吃飯，好開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊！而且今天收入不錯，一定要多吃一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小祥千萬別客氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……沒有……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前這個明顯就不富裕的家，光禿禿的泥巴牆、微弱的油燈……\n為什麼睦的夢裡，會出現這些？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小睦，還有南……這位是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是我從小認識的朋友，祥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來是想問你們，要不要共進晚餐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做了很多份，如果你們願意的話，就一起來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這怎麼好意思呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽你們的鄰居說，你們家的煙囪好像幾天都沒動靜了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸摸肚子）唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，離上次聚會已經快一個月了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都很想再聽到小睦的演奏呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話……小睦，你是怎麼想的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我……我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小祥肯定也很想聽小睦的演奏吧？就算聽了這麼多次，還是百聽不厭呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不介意的話，就在我們家辦聚會吧！其實我們剛剛還在討論要請大家一起來吃飯呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥，你覺得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得……睦，由你自己來決定吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯，那我願意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g9_warmrabbitnest"},{"type":"narration","text":"喧鬧聲，歡笑聲，乾杯聲。\n不大的屋子裡擠滿了人，但大家好像並不在意空間有多麼狹小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來來來，再來一杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一杯，讓我們歡迎小睦的朋友——祥子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦——祥子，你好！"},{"type":"narration","text":"大家一齊看向坐在角落的祥子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（舉起酒杯）小祥……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乾、乾杯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乾杯——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歡迎儀式過後，大家的注意力又重新回到了聚會本身。祥子獨自靠在角落的牆上，眼神複雜地看著眼前的這一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睦……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實……我全都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一切都是假的，南會對我這麼溫柔，都是假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這都是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以見到你的時候，我就知道，自己該回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，給我一個機會吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個告別的機會，然後再結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少在這裡，我也想像你們一樣，能自由地歌唱一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"睦……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"還沒等祥子回應，睦抱著吉他，緩緩朝人群走去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小睦，你準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……大家好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小睦，你怎麼了？有什麼問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……椅子，我的椅子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睦的母親","speakerId":"avg_npc_1939_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經準備好囉。喏，這個椅子，是你常用的那張吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"睦小心地觀察著那把高腳椅，椅面上布滿了深深的裂紋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，就是它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"睦緩緩坐下，所有人都跟著放輕了呼吸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，請聆聽……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"《春日影》。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i07_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"一生都無法忘記的旋律，在睦的夢境中再次被奏響。\n跟記憶裡一樣，此刻睦手中吉他的聲音無比清澈悠揚，溫暖著每一個人。\n眼前的若葉睦，卻讓祥子感到無比陌生。\n她已經不是那個不善於表達自己感情的睦了。\n雖然她還在努力嘗試學會表達，但她在這裡，似乎很幸福。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“內心滿是憔悴，眼神顫抖不止”\n“我在這世界孤獨一人”\n“這不斷凋零的春季”\n“每年都只予我冰冷”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"睦，這也是你的願望嗎……"},{"type":"narration","text":"今天她有無數次機會拉睦離開這裡，而且她相信睦一定會跟她走。\n然而她始終不忍心這麼做。\n因為現在的睦，看起來像是發自內心地感到幸福。\n人們隨著音樂輕晃著身體，微弱的燭光將他們的影子映在了牆上，就像春日暖陽下搖曳的樹影一般。\n而睦坐在椅子上，被所有人包圍著。她閉著雙眼，手在琴弦間來回撥動，輕聲歌唱。\n此刻的她，又在想些什麼呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“令人揪心又惹人憐愛”\n“感覺此刻就能夠明白”\n“使人幸福又催人痴迷”\n“照耀著無法哭泣的我”\n“光芒溫柔地攜我同行——”\n莫名的情緒籠罩在祥子的心頭——\n是欣慰……還是不甘？抑或兩者都有。\n現在的若葉睦，比和自己在一起時還要開心。\n睦就這麼認真地獨自坐在椅子上，唱著熟悉的歌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“透過層層雲彩，不斷閃閃發光”\n“填滿心靈又滿溢而出”\n“臉頰不知不覺，亦在閃閃發光”\n“熱淚沾濕了我的面龐”\n“你的手為何如此溫暖”\n“求求你，從此再也不要放開——”\n如果不鬆開手的話——\n睦在這裡找到的幸福就——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i07_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子轉過身，倉皇而逃。\n就這樣，消失在夜色中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
